# Flutter Standards

- Flutter + Bloc/Cubit; repository pattern; Dio; GoRouter; Freezed; secure storage.
- Separate merchant and customer apps.
- Tokens in secure storage only.
- Offline-safe UX for critical reads where practical; never invent payment success offline.
- Generate models from OpenAPI when available.
- Unit + widget tests for critical flows.
- Merchant enrollment wizard (when implemented) must surface session states from device-management docs; iOS path shows Configurator/ABM prerequisites, not an Android QR fake.
- Customer app shows device status only; it does not enroll Device Owner / MDM.
